// `cross` is the one arity-specific kernel: a cross product exists in three dimensions, and the
// bundle binds every arity from two upwards. A 2-component receiver is refused by name at the call
// rather than reading past its components — the runtime twin of the impl-site shape check.
// expect: error E0007 at 11:6
// expect: exit 1
use std.{vec}

@packed struct IVec2 { x: i32; y: i32 }
impl vec.Kernels for IVec2 {}

echo IVec2 { x: 1i32, y: 2i32 }.cross(IVec2 { x: 3i32, y: 4i32 })
